// ============================================================================
// RUSSIAN (ru) - Soviet allies on the Berlin maps (t3l1/t3l2 and any map using the
// soviet_* models). Added 2026-08-02 (bug-1288).
//
// WHY THIS EXISTS: MOHAA's team enum has only american/german, with no Soviet value, so
// Soviet actors fall through as GERMAN - and before this pool existed aivoice_nationality
// returned "de" for them, i.e. Russian soldiers were speaking German barks at the player.
//
// SOURCE: the retail per-nationality MULTIPLAYER voice sets, which include a full Russian
// reel (44 files in mainta, 61 in maintt) alongside American/British/German/Italian. These
// are spoken in Russian; the English text below is the retail subtitle, kept so the meaning
// of each line is auditable against the situation it is mapped to.
//
// mandown and reload are deliberately ABSENT - the Russian reel has no line that fits, and
// the house rule (see the uk pool) is to stay SILENT rather than borrow another language.
// ============================================================================

// coop_av_ru_contact
alias coop_av_ru_contact1 sound/dialogue/Multiplayer/Russian/dfr_mpsr_RS7551to2.mp3 soundparms 1.15 0.10 1.0 0.05 220 2400 dialog streamed maps "m e t dm obj train"   // "Enemy Spotted."
alias coop_av_ru_contact2 sound/dialogue/Multiplayer/Russian/dfr_mpic_RS7548to3.mp3 soundparms 1.15 0.10 1.0 0.05 220 2400 dialog streamed maps "m e t dm obj train"   // "Open fire!"

