// ============================================================================================
// coop_av_us_wounded  [user 2026-09-02, bug-2321]
//
// "there is plenty of dialogue from Omaha, one is a prayer that gets whispered, the other is lines
// like 'my guts have been torn out' and many others that we can have the actors you've added say too."
//
// THE OMAHA-SPECIFIC ONES CANNOT BE USED. dfr_scripted_M3L1_034e is declared, admitted on this map,
// and its subtitle really is "My gut's been torn out!" - but only its .lip and .skc ship in War
// Chest, never the .wav. m3l1a.scr:4494 speaks it, which is why the line has been SEEN as a subtitle
// over a silently moving mouth. The whispered prayer is the same story.
//
// So the pool is built from the 39 generic American damage and death lines that DO ship and that
// nothing in the game currently plays. They are the wounded-man vocabulary the beach never had.
// Positional (`loaded`, not `streamed`) at 200/2000 so a casualty is heard from where he is lying,
// matching coop_av_us_panic immediately above rather than retail's headless 2D dialogue.
// ============================================================================================
alias coop_av_us_wounded1 sound/dialogue/Generic/A/damage/dfr_damage_01a.wav soundparms 1.15 0.10 1.0 0.05 200 2000 dialog loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_av_us_wounded2 sound/dialogue/Generic/A/damage/dfr_damage_01c.wav soundparms 1.15 0.10 1.0 0.05 200 2000 dialog loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_av_us_wounded3 sound/dialogue/Generic/A/damage/dfr_damage_01d.wav soundparms 1.15 0.10 1.0 0.05 200 2000 dialog loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_av_us_wounded4 sound/dialogue/Generic/A/damage/dfr_damage_01e.wav soundparms 1.15 0.10 1.0 0.05 200 2000 dialog loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
